<style>
    @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
    .page {
        width: 794px; height: 1123px;
        padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
        overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
        position: relative;
        font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif;
    }
    .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
    /* Basic styling to mimic document structure */
    .form-section { margin-bottom: 20px; }
    .label-group { display: flex; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 10px; }
    .label-group label { margin-right: 15px; }
    .input-line { border-bottom: 1px solid #000; width: 100%; margin-top: 5px; }
    .checkbox-group { display: flex; align-items: center; margin-top: 5px; }
    .checkbox-group label { margin-right: 15px; }
</style>

<div class="page">
    <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 40px;">
        <h1 style="font-size: 18pt; font-weight: bold;">INTAKE FORM TO FILL OUT AND RETURN TO LOYOLA</h1>
    </div>

    <div class="form-section">
        <div class="label-group">
            Today's Date: <span class="input-line" style="width: 200px;">{{ today_date }}</span>
        </div>
        <div class="label-group">
            Requested Wedding Date: <span class="input-line" style="width: 200px;">{{ requested_wedding_date }}</span>
        </div>
        <div class="label-group">
            Requested Wedding Time: <span class="input-line" style="width: 200px;">{{ requested_wedding_time }}</span>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="form-section">
        <p>Did you download, read and agree to all of the information contained in the Wedding Information Packet found at <span data-field="packet_url">{{ packet_url }}</span>? <span class="checkbox-group">
            <label><input type="checkbox"> Yes</label>
            <label><input type="checkbox"> No</label>
        </span></p>
        <p>Are you civilly married, or will you be civilly married before your wedding at <span data-field="wedding_location">{{ wedding_location }}</span>? <span class="checkbox-group">
            <label><input type="checkbox"> Yes</label>
            <label><input type="checkbox"> No</label>
        </span></p>
    </div>

    <!-- Bride Information -->
    <div class="form-section" style="border-top: 1px solid #000; padding-top: 15px;">
        <h2 style="font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 10px;">Bride Information:</h2>

        <div class="label-group">
            Officer of the Administration:
            <span class="input-line" style="width: 300px;">{{ bride_officer_admin }}</span>
            Department: <span class="input-line" style="width: 200px;">{{ bride_department }}</span>
        </div>

        <div class="label-group">
            <label><input type="checkbox"> Academic Faculty/Staff, Position</label>
            <label><input type="checkbox"> Resident Employee</label>
            <label><input type="checkbox"> Student/Alum, graduation date</label>
        </div>

        <div class="label-group">
            Is the bride Roman Catholic? <span class="checkbox-group">
                <label><input type="checkbox"> Yes</label>
                <label><input type="checkbox"> No</label>
            </span>
        </div>
        <p>If no, what is the bride's religion? <span class="input-line" style="width: 300px;">{{ bride_religion }}</span></p>

        <div class="label-group">
            Has the bride ever been married before (either in a church, civilly, or by common law)? <span class="checkbox-group">
                <label><input type="checkbox"> Yes</label>
                <label><input type="checkbox"> No</label>
            </span>
        </div>
        <p>Bride full legal name: <span class="input-line" style="width: 500px;">{{ bride_full_name }}</span></p>
        <p>Bride current address (street, city, state, zip): <span class="input-line" style="width: 500px;">{{ bride_address }}</span></p>
        <p>Bride phone (cell/work/home): <span class="input-line" style="width: 500px;">{{ bride_phone }}</span></p>
        <p>Bride email: <span class="input-line" style="width: 500px;">{{ bride_email }}</span></p>
        <p>Bride home parish (name/address): <span class="input-line" style="width: 500px;">{{ bride_parish }}</span></p>
    </div>

    <!-- Groom Information -->
    <div class="form-section" style="border-top: 1px solid #000; padding-top: 15px;">
        <h2 style="font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 10px;">Groom Information:</h2>

        <div class="label-group">
            Officer of the Administration:
            <span class="input-line" style="width: 300px;">{{ groom_officer_admin }}</span>
            Department: <span class="input-line" style="width: 200px;">{{ groom_department }}</span>
        </div>

        <div class="label-group">
            <label><input type="checkbox"> Academic Faculty/Staff, Position</label>
            <label><input type="checkbox"> Resident Employee</label>
            <label><input type="checkbox"> Student/Alum, graduation date</label>
        </div>

        <div class="label-group">
            Is the groom Roman Catholic? <span class="checkbox-group">
                <label><input type="checkbox"> Yes</label>
                <label><input type="checkbox"> No</label>
            </span>
        </div>
        <p>If no, what is the groom's religion? <span class="input-line" style="width: 300px;">{{ groom_religion }}</span></p>

        <div class="label-group">
            Has the groom ever been married before (either in a church, civilly, or by common law)? <span class="checkbox-group">
                <label><input type="checkbox"> Yes</label>
                <label><input type="checkbox"> No</label>
            </span>
        </div>
        <p>Groom full legal name: <span class="input-line" style="width: 500px;">{{ groom_full_name }}</span></p>
        <p>Groom current address (street, city, state, zip): <span class="input-line" style="width: 500px;">{{ groom_address }}</span></p>
        <p>Groom phone (cell/work/home): <span class="input-line" style="width: 500px;">{{ groom_phone }}</span></p>
        <p>Groom email: <span class="input-line" style="width: 500px;">{{ groom_email }}</span></p>
        <p>Groom home parish (name/address): <span class="input-line" style="width: 500px;">{{ groom_parish }}</span></p>
    </div>

    <div class="form-section">
        <p>Is there any additional information we should be aware of as we plan your wedding, i.e. widowed, previously married, etc.? <span class="input-line" style="width: 100%;">{{ additional_info }}</span></p>
    </div>

    <div class="form-section">
        <p>Additional comments: <span class="input-line" style="width: 100%;">{{ additional_comments }}</span></p>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-top: 50px; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 1.5;">
        <p>Kindly return this form via email to <span data-field="return_email">{{ return_email }}</span>. We will reply regarding the availability of your requested date and time.</p>
        <p>Should you have any questions, please call <span data-field="contact_phone">{{ contact_phone }}</span> or email Meg at <span data-field="contact_email">{{ contact_email }}</span>.</p>
    </div>
</div>